    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "textbook-findbirthday-definition",
        "moduleId": "read-only-operation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材定义：FindBirthday",
        "markdown": "FindBirthday 是一个查询操作：它在状态中查找输入 $name?$，并把对应的生日作为输出 $date!$ 返回。由于这个操作从不改变状态，教材用一个包含 BirthdayBook 的 $\\Xi$ schema 来书写它。\n\n查找只读取已有的登记，不新增、不删除，也不修改任何生日记录。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-2af98d1121e7e235ed121771",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000038"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Introduction to the Z Specification Language",
                "A State-Inspecting Operation"
              ],
              "lineStart": 459,
              "lineEnd": 464,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "93c9c446e0de4d935f9fcce13da4d0a6110c84762991168f8ef0758349f8e22f"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-read-only-framing",
        "moduleId": "read-only-operation",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "为什么查询操作也要写规格",
        "markdown": "只读不等于无需说明。规格至少要交代三件事：从哪里读、读到的结果是什么、读不到时怎么办。$\\Xi$ schema 把“状态保持原样”写成可以被检查的约束，而不是留给读者默契。\n\n与更新操作相比，查询操作的风险通常不在于破坏数据，而在于把没有定义的情况说成有结果。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-findbirthday-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-xi-double-copy",
        "moduleId": "xi-schema-structure",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材说明：Ξ schema 的两个状态副本",
        "markdown": "教材指出，$\\Xi$ schema 内部同样包含 BirthdayBook 的两个状态副本，就像 $\\Delta$ schema 一样。差别在于 $\\Xi$ 还加入隐式约束，要求前后状态相同：$known' = known$ 且 $birthday' = birthday$。\n\n正因为 $\\Delta$ 与 $\\Xi$ schema 的内部结构一致，它们可以被方便地组合使用。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-2af98d1121e7e235ed121771",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000038"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Introduction to the Z Specification Language",
                "A State-Inspecting Operation"
              ],
              "lineStart": 459,
              "lineEnd": 464,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "93c9c446e0de4d935f9fcce13da4d0a6110c84762991168f8ef0758349f8e22f"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-xi-as-delta-plus-frame",
        "moduleId": "xi-schema-structure",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "把 Ξ 读成 Δ 加一组框架等式",
        "markdown": "可以记成：$\\Xi$ 描述“带着前后状态，但其实什么也没改”。读这种 schema 时，先按 $\\Delta$ 的方式认出初始变量与带撇变量，再检查那组等式是否把两者钉死。\n\n这类框架等式的作用是：只要前置条件成立，操作结束时每个状态变量都与开始时相等。因此判断一个操作是否改变状态，看的是这些等式，而不是操作的名字。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-xi-double-copy"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-output-equation",
        "moduleId": "output-definition",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "教材公式：输出由输入与状态定义",
        "markdown": "教材中的等式用输入变量 $name?$ 和状态变量 $birthday$ 定义输出变量 $date!$：\n\n$$date! = birthday(name?)$$\n\n这里的等号不是程序里的赋值，而是规格中的约束：在任何满足前置条件的初始状态下，$date!$ 必须取 $birthday(name?)$ 的值。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-2af98d1121e7e235ed121771",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000038"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Introduction to the Z Specification Language",
                "A State-Inspecting Operation"
              ],
              "lineStart": 459,
              "lineEnd": 464,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "93c9c446e0de4d935f9fcce13da4d0a6110c84762991168f8ef0758349f8e22f"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-findbirthday-trace",
        "moduleId": "output-definition",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "走一遍查询",
        "markdown": "设状态为 $known = \\{alice, bob\\}$，$birthday = \\{alice \\mapsto d_1,\\ bob \\mapsto d_2\\}$，并满足不变式 $known = \\mathrm{dom}\\,birthday$。\n\n查询 $name? = alice$ 时，前置条件 $alice \\in known$ 成立，输出 $date! = d_1$；再查询 $bob$ 时，输出 $date! = d_2$。两次查询前后 $known$ 与 $birthday$ 都保持原值，两个状态副本在这条轨迹上逐项相等。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-findbirthday-definition",
            "textbook-output-equation"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-findbirthday-precondition",
        "moduleId": "precondition-and-errors",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "warning",
        "title": "教材说明：前置条件与未定义情形",
        "markdown": "FindBirthday 受前置条件 $name? \\in known$ 约束：这个名字必须已经登记了生日。若不满足，$birthday(name?)$ 无定义，输出表达式也就没有可返回的值。\n\n教材还指出，同一个操作可以由多个 schema 描述，各自规定不同的前置条件；把它们组合起来就能得到更一般的操作，从而把错误情形单独说明。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-2af98d1121e7e235ed121771",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000038"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Introduction to the Z Specification Language",
                "A State-Inspecting Operation"
              ],
              "lineStart": 459,
              "lineEnd": 464,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "93c9c446e0de4d935f9fcce13da4d0a6110c84762991168f8ef0758349f8e22f"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-precondition-cases",
        "moduleId": "precondition-and-errors",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "前置条件把调用分成两类",
        "markdown": "对一个具体的 BirthdayBook 状态，查询名字的取值只有两类：\n\n1. $name? \\in known$：查询有定义，输出由 $birthday(name?)$ 唯一确定，状态按框架等式保持不变。\n2. $name? \\notin known$：前置条件不成立，该 schema 不再承诺任何输出。\n\n因此“查不到生日”不是返回空值或随便一个日期，而是落在规格未定义的区域。要给出可用的错误处理，需要再写一个覆盖该情形的 schema，而不是修改查询本身。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-findbirthday-precondition",
            "textbook-output-equation"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-read-only-check",
        "moduleId": "check-and-bridge",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "检查与过渡",
        "markdown": "自检三个问题：这个 schema 改变状态吗？它的输出由什么决定？它在什么条件下才有定义？\n\n把握这三点，就能把 $\\Xi$ 查询模式迁移到其他只读操作：先找输入与输出，再看框架等式是否锁住前后状态，最后补上使查询有定义的前置条件。下一步会看到更多操作 schema，用同样的前后状态关系描述查询、更新与初始化。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-xi-double-copy",
            "textbook-findbirthday-definition",
            "textbook-findbirthday-precondition"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
